  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oil &amp; Gas scoping study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since the recent offshore oil and gas discovery in Senegal, there has been a demand for expertise regarding effective and responsible natural resource management and governance. This scoping study aims to gain a better understanding of the local context to identify and justify the most appropriate capacity-building interventions that will assist the Senegalese government. The aim is to ensure that any potential exploration of oil and gas reserves will benefit socio-economic development while avoiding any harmful effects on the environment and the climate.</narrative>
  </description>
